WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Use the label preview to confirm the template, preparation date, quantity and printer/media settings.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.083
Step 2: In the system print dialog, select the installed printer, matching paper size, 100%/actual scale, no headers or footers and zero margins.

3
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:21.542
Step 3: For a Zebra-file workflow, download the ZPL and send it through your installed Zebra software or configured print service.

4
00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:29.000
Step 4: Check the physical label for media calibration, resolution and margins. Ask your device administrator if no printer is available.
